  "description": "Evaluates the stability and reliability of polar base station communication systems",
  "definition": "BSCSI = CRI \\times (1 + 0.2 \\times \\text{radio signal (dBm)} \\div 100) \\times (1 - 0.01 \\times (1000 - \\text{latency (ms)}))"
}

