  "knowledge": "Communication Network Resilience Assessment (CNRA)",
  "description": "Assesses the resilience and interference resistance of polar communication networks",
  "definition": "Communication networks are assessed as having 'High Resilience' (CRI > 0.8 and BSCSI > 0.85), 'Medium Resilience' (CRI > 0.6 and BSCSI > 0.7), or 'Low Resilience' (other cases)."
